{
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "A **string** is a sequence of **characters** — letters, digits, spaces, punctuation, emoji. `\"hello\"` is five characters in a row. Like an array, each character has an **index**, counted from 0, and the number of characters is the string's **length**."
    },
